ames 26–30)\n\nEach has:\n- Unique costumes\n- Unique on-screen labels\n- Different choreography and emotional tone\n- Clear progression in the competition narrative\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Final Count: **3 distinct Olympic ice dance events/programs shown from Vancouver 2010**\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\nThe answer **'3' is correct**. The video shows **three distinct competition segments** (Compulsory Dance, Original Dance, Free Dance) from the **Vancouver 2010 Olympic Games**, all featuring Tessa Virtue and Scott Moir in ice dance. This matches the standard Olympic ice dance format and is clearly supported by visual and textual evidence in the frames."}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 44, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0521.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0522.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0523.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0918.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0919.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0920.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0921.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0922.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0923.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0924.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0925.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0926.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0927.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0928.jpg'], 'response': "Based on a careful analysis of the 14 provided frames, the answer **'3'** (meaning 3 games/events at the Vancouver 2010 Olympic Games) is **incorrect**.\n\nHere’s the breakdown of the visual evidence:\n\n---\n\n###